{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nFoundation for the Worktrees page.\n\n## Spec\n- `page \"worktrees\"` in `assets/default.kdl`, `\"7\" \"page:worktrees\"`\n- Data via `git worktree list --porcelain` and `git stash list` (git2 where convenient); refresh on fs change like the Git page\n- `src/worktrees/` with `PageState` / `PaneSet` wiring\n\nPart of #103.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T07:14:53Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":104,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Worktrees: page skeleton"}
